{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sushi Cat Legacy Collection</strong>\u00a0introduces a new way to play a beloved franchise!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620940/extras/3a7411aae8ec7d6d7875a11323e46b67.avif?t=1759927083\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the complete saga of the squishiest, sushi-loving feline! This collection bundles the entire beloved web series for the first time on Steam, preserved and brought to modern PCs. Relive the journey from the very first bounce to the final epic launch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This collection includes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sushi Cat</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sushi Cat: The Honeymoon</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sushi Cat 2</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sushi Cat 2: The Great Purrade</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sushi Cat-a-pult</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sushi Cat: StoryCraft World Creator</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620940/extras/5bdc76f32dee4d19fcaed451db959484.avif?t=1759927083\" width=616 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return to the simple, yet infinitely addictive gameplay that defined a generation of browser games. The goal is simple: drop your adorable blue hero from the top of the screen and watch him bounce, tumble, and eat his way through intricate levels. With each piece of sushi he eats, he gets bigger and bouncier! Strategize your drops to maximize sushi intake, hit special power-ups, and fill his belly to win the heart of his beloved.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Satisfying Physics:</strong> Enjoy the simple pleasure of watching Sushi Cat pinball his way down the screen, gobbling up everything in his path.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Charming Story:</strong> Help our hero overcome obstacles and reunite with his pink-bowed crush in a series of sweet, animated cutscenes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dozens of Levels:</strong> Master a huge variety of unique and challenging puzzles across all the classic games and their expansions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620940/extras/8ebfedf611eac96a0d1b753ea3465d89.avif?t=1759927083\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When carefully dropping isn't enough, it's time to LAUNCH! <i>Sushi Cat-a-pult</i> completely flips the script. Instead of a gentle drop, you'll be flinging our hero through the sky in a high-flying, physics-based adventure. Aim your catapult, adjust your power, and try to launch Sushi Cat as far as possible, collecting sushi and cash mid-air to purchase powerful upgrades.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High-Flying Action:</strong> Launch Sushi Cat and use limited bounces and special abilities to stay airborne and travel farther.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgradeable Gadgets:</strong> Spend your earnings on hilarious and helpful items like magnets, bird seed, and launch power to improve your distance and score.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Aim for the High Score:</strong> Compete with yourself to beat your best distance. Every run earns you more cash for upgrades, encouraging one more launch to shatter your record!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3620940?t=1759927083","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3620940?t=1759927083","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620940/98c7d8dcc1ba9afd4eaddd4b7da4647b5bb7f367/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759927083","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620940/98c7d8dcc1ba9afd4eaddd4b7da4647b5bb7f367/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759927083","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sushi Cat Legacy Collection</strong>\u00a0introduces a new way to play a beloved franchise!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620940/extras/3a7411aae8ec7d6d7875a11323e46b67.avif?t=1759927083\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the complete saga of the squishiest, sushi-loving feline! This collection bundles the entire beloved web series for the first time on Steam, preserved and brought to modern PCs. Relive the journey from the very first bounce to the final epic launch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This collection includes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sushi Cat</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sushi Cat: The Honeymoon</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sushi Cat 2</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sushi Cat 2: The Great Purrade</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sushi Cat-a-pult</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sushi Cat: StoryCraft World Creator</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\